$0(){return A.kX(this.a,"# Pedal Demo \u2014 hold the pedal to shape a steady tone.\nname Pedal Demo\n\nfilter ClassicOscillator osc1\nknob osc1 freq 330.0\nknob osc1 waveform 0\n\n# The pedal CV drives the VCA gain directly, so the output IS the pedal's\n# shape. Hold the button; try each Mode; sweep Time.\nfilter Pedal ped1\nknob ped1 mode 3          # Linear Decay \u2014 a plucked envelope on press\nknob ped1 time 0.4\n\nfilter Volume vca1\nknob vca1 volume 0.8\n\npatch osc1 out_pcm -> vca1 in_pcm\npatch ped1 out_cv -> vca1 in_gain_cv\noutput vca1 out_pcm\n\npanel knob ped1 pedal\npanel knob ped1 mode\npanel knob ped1 time\npanel knob vca1 volume\n\n"+A.iy())},
